Z||000009||Haze_Performance||09-06-2000||10:29 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, lucidatypewriter">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierospeeder:<BR><B>I have the original application and brochure of the club, which i eventually have to send in if i remember.<P>But do you still get those discounts at Pepboys??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Product Testing: Last year they sent me a new style Ford Motorsports Cobra Intake to test. They sent a bunch of forms to fill out. and I had to send them back in 6 months. VERY COOL!!!! A friend already had the same intake on his 90 LX so I sold mine on Ebay for $256.00........ What a Deal  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I was told that I was the first Fox Body Mustang to join. I sent in all the info on all 3 of my Mustangs.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">   <B>1985 Sport Coupe </B><P><BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>H.M.P. </A></B>||||reg||7
